{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn7le14ob11re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le14ob11re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn7le14ob11re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn7le14ob11re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Miranda, how are you feeling?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: I'm tired, but what an amazing party, if you ask me. I was reluctant about this event at first, but, personally, I think having the two events happen simultaneously helped divert attention from the media leak. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Are you saying we avoided bad press and helped Farmani rebrand?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: I'd say we've directed attention to Farmani's new clothing line and helped him connect with a new audience.", "id": 1, "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn7le14ob11re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Right. I'm giving both you and Peter a raise. You two have guaranteed that I've made the right decision. You have charisma, Miranda.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Does that mean I get a new office? Or is it just a bonus?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Ok, let's backtrack. I don't think a new office is necessary. However, you are happy with a raise, aren't you? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Of course! Thank you Janet.", "id": 2, "time": "28000"}, {"image": "engenn7le14ob11re2img07.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: I guess it's time to discuss what we're doing next. What's on your agenda?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: My intention is to contact Ferdinand and get his feedback.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: I'd say that sounds appropriate.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: I strongly believe that there will be lots of activity about the events online. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Perhaps. That video of you went viral.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Real funny, Janet. Anyways, I'm expecting to hear from Ferdinand soon.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Sounds to me like you're on top of things like usual. Keep me in the loop.", "id": 3, "time": "53000"}]}}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "I can give opinions.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can talk about jobs and work.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can ask for clarification.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " How do you usually feel after attending an event?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "What aspects of the party do you usually talk about? The music? The people?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Let's review!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Janet and Miranda chat about the party. What do they talk about? ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", 