ntent": "engenn7le14ob11re7pdf01.pdf", "type": "pdf"}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "DWS", "id": 11, "stimuli_ids": []}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Reaching an Agreement", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Talking About the Party", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 11, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 14, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Accurately use information about common technology in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn7le14ob11re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Dealing With Communication Breakdown", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Sometimes you don't understand what was said, or something was not clear to you. It is important to get clarification from the person you are speaking with. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<ul><li>Use a tag question<br/><span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"underline\">You're</span> happy with getting a raise, <span class=\"underline\">aren't you?</span></span></li><br/><li>Use the phrases <span class=\"italic\">\u201cdo you mean ... \u201d</span>, <span class=\"italic\">\u201care you saying ... \u201d</span>, <span class=\"italic\">\u201cdoes that mean ... \u201d</span> and the information you need clarification on.<br/><span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"underline\">Are you saying</span> we avoided bad press and helped Farmani rebrand?<br/><span class=\"underline\">Does that mean</span> I can get a new office with a window?<br/><span class=\"underline\">Do you mean</span> to say that we've actually helped them?</span></li><br/><li>Use the conjunction \u201cor\u201d followed by the clarification you need to make.<br/><span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"underline\">Or</span> is this just a bonus for all the work I've done?</span></ul>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Giving Opinions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Conversations are far more interesting when people interact during the conversation. It is important to ask for others' opinions on a subject as well as giving your own. Here are some ways you can give opinions. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<ul><li>clause +, <span class=\"italic\">if you ask me.</span> </li><li><span class=\"italic\">Personally</span>, + clause.  </li><li><span class=\"italic\">I think</span> + clause.  </li><li><span class=\"italic\">I'd say</span> + clause.  </li><li><span class=\"italic\">I say</span> + clause. </li><li><span class=\"italic\">I strongly believe</span> + clause.  </li><ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The party was amazing, <span class=\"underline\">if you ask me.</span>", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"underline\">Personally</span>, I think it was a good idea to have both events happening at the same time.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"underline\">I'd say</span> this helped the company connect with a new audience. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"underline\">I say</span> we contact him and get his assessment.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"underline\">I strongly believe</span> people will be talking about this on the internet. ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "reluctant", "type": "name"}, {"content": "not willing to do something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I was very reluctant about this event at first.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le14ob11aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about things that happened at an event. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "leak", "type": "name"}, {"content": "private or secret information given to journalists or to the public", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It helped us divert attention from the leak. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le14ob11aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "bad press", "type": "name"}, {"content": "criticism that appears in the news", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We need to avoid bad press. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le14ob11aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to rebrand", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to change the corporate image of a company ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We avoided bad press and helped the company rebrand. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le14ob11aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to direct attention to", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to focus someone's concern on something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We helped direct attention to their new clothing line.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le14ob11aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to connect with", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to make someone understand something and have the same ideas and opinions", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We helped him connect with a new audience.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le14ob11aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to guarantee", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to promise something will happen", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I can guarantee I have made the right decision. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le14ob11aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to have charisma", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to posses a strong personal quality that makes other people like you", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You do have charisma, Miranda.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le14ob11aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "intention", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a plan in your mind to do something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: My intention is to contact him and get some feedback.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le14ob11aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Write three to five questions related to an office event held recently. (For example, did you like the party? Why?)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Go around the office or your room and ask questions. Make sure you record the answers.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask people to elaborate on their answers. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask for clarification when you do not understand a response. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Compile the results of your survey and share them with your colleagues.  ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I write questions about an office event.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask questions and record answers.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask people for their opinions. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask for clarification when I don't understand something. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about my answers with friends. ", "type": "text"}]}]}